throw :
-----------
--> throw is a keyword, if we want to create exception object and throw 
    explicitly from the method we use to throw keywords.

syntax: throw exceptionObj;

--> using throw keyword we can throw checked exceptions and unchecked 
    exceptions.

try with multiple catch blocks 
------------------------------
--> if multiple exceptions are there in try block and on the occurrence
    of different exceptions if we want to execute different handling code 
    then we should use multiple catch blocks.
